      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Increasing Access",
      "Anchor": "increasing-access",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Not sure where to start?\nThe Advertising API, Community Management API, Events Management API, Lead Sync API, Conversions API, and Matched Audiences API are open to all approved developers \u2014 apply through the standard process. Access to Audience Insights and Media Planning APIs is restricted to developers who meet additional qualification criteria evaluated by LinkedIn. The Company Intelligence API is not currently accepting new applications.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
